# phase-085 — Decode `\uXXXX` in a string literal instead of silently dropping the backslash

<!-- GENERATED by rbops/gen-prompts.sh from rbops/phases.json. DO NOT EDIT. -->

| | |
|---|---|
| Severity | `blocker` |
| Risk | `low` |
