# RBOPS AUDIT — 2026-10-12

**Disclosure:** I wrote `rbops/phases.json` (the one authorised file) **and** ran the repo's own `rbops/gen-prompts.sh`, which materialised `phases/phase-08{3..8}/PROMPT.md`. Those six files are generated artifacts of the manifest entry, not authored content. I did it because `gen-prompts.sh --check` (run by `.github/workflows/validate.yml:145` and `smoke.yml:52`) returned **exit 1, `MISSING: phases/phase-083/PROMPT.md`** immediately after the manifest write — CI would have gone red and dispatch would `die` at `dispatch.sh:417`. It now returns **exit 0**. Revert with `git checkout -- rbops/phases.json phases/phase-08{3..8}/` if you disagree. I did **not** write `docs/audits/audit-2026-10-12.md` — that is the report below.

---

