| `src/**/*.rs` | 34 files, 27,326 lines |
| `cargo test` | **1414 passed, 0 failed, 0 ignored** |
| `cargo clippy --all-targets` | **0 warnings** |
| `#[test]` in `tests/*.rs` | 1,225 across 51 files (+52 `tests/common/`, +135 in `src/`) |
