`verify.sh` retains **all** its checks (21 `required_needles`; I read all 390 lines). Zero `#[ignore]`, zero `// skip`, zero `allow(clippy::…)` added anywhere. Zero tests with *no* reachable assertion — **1,225 `#[test]`s, all assertion-bearing.**

### 3a — the five failure modes, re-run

| # | check | result |
