| 4 | every phase has a PROMPT.md + `must_touch` | **OK.** All 88 have prompts (after generation). `must_touch` absent on phase-001..010 only — all `.done`, historical. |
| 5 | every agent has its permissions | **BROKEN.** `~/.config/opencode/opencode.json` is 213 B and declares **no `agent` key** (`jq has("agent")` → false); `redblue/` has no `opencode.json`; `dispatch.sh:786` runs `--dir "$PROJECT_DIR" --agent reviewer`. It resolves to the global `default_agent: build`, which grants `edit: allow` **and** `bash: allow`. `dispatch.sh:727-732` fixed the *contract* by inlining it; the *permissions* are still unenforced. → **phase-084** |

